-- Backfills real ElevenLabs narration audio URLs for production.
-- The audio was generated locally (scripts/generateNarration.js against
-- the local dev DB) but the mp3 files themselves were gitignored and never
-- shipped, and this UPDATE was only ever run against localhost:5433 -
-- production never had a single real chapter audio_url. The files are now
-- committed to packages/backend/public/audio/generated/ (same pattern as
-- migration 052-054's covers), so they deploy with the app.
--
-- Matched by (audiobook title, chapter title), not chapter id - same fix
-- migration 054 already had to make for covers: chapters.id defaults to
-- gen_random_uuid() and none of the content-seeding migrations pin an
-- explicit id, so production's chapter ids are different random values
-- than this dev machine's. Title pairs are confirmed unique across the
-- whole catalog (verified via a GROUP BY ... HAVING count(*) > 1 query).
-- The stored localhost URL is intentional - resolveLocalMediaUrl() in
-- audiobookController.js rewrites the host/scheme to the real request's
-- at read time (same mechanism covers already rely on).
